      "id": "claim_75fa0350cec94ef9861e0ae91c5bfdec",
      "statement": "Four chat-server limits, DTCC_AGENT_MONTHLY_SPEND_USD, DTCC_AGENT_TURNS_PER_CHAT, DTCC_AGENT_TURN_SECONDS and DTCC_AGENT_MODEL_CONCURRENCY, are each off when unset, and a non-numeric, non-finite or too-small value stops the server at startup.",
