      "id": "claim_934d68df580e449cb598c55730efe809",
      "statement": "Every Bedrock request, including the fresh retry and the startup probe, goes through LimitedModel, which holds a concurrency slot and reserves the request's worst-case cost in the spend ledger before it starts, refusing it with LimitReached if the reservation would pass the monthly limit, and settles the reservation with the actual cost afterwards.",
